  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **You or Your Memory**: back after 40 archived shows (1355 days) [5]\n- **Liza Minnelli Forever**: back after 70 archived shows (1985 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **Short Song About the 10 Freeway**: back after 28 archived shows (815 days); rare: 5 archived performances [5]\n- **No, I Can't**: back after 26 archived shows (811 days); rare: 13 archived performances [5]\n- **The Sign**: back after 59 archived shows (1895 days) [5]\n- **In the Hidden Places**: back after 36 archived shows (1175 days) [5]\n- **Carmen Cicero**: back after 81 archived shows (2638 days) [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2016-09-02.aud.flac** (recommended): audience recording; 18 songs; 79 min; rated 3.33/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Monitor crackle occasionally sounds like clipping; otherwise the recording turned out well, with small-crowd atmosphere audible [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Recorder stood front row, dead center, in front of a stage monitor that crackled at several points [1]\n- Venue was very small by 2016 Mountain Goats standards; John Darnielle played acoustic guitar and keyboard, Matt Douglas saxophones, guitar and keyboard [1]\n- Reviewer says this was their first Mountain Goats show, now relived almost ten years later [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2016-09-02.aud.flac**: taped by Nigel Ewan; transferred by Nigel Ewan/Andrew Pirtle; source: AUD > Zoom H4 (onboard mics) [1]. Also: Taper used a Zoom H4 recorder kept in a shirt pocket throughout the show; source and lineage added to metadata [3]",
